    "text": "First there will be an acid-base reaction between <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math> .<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/sbozroqqvjgjwjjyxwgurdmttggpahqkncdulfvjxiabdbriwo.jpeg\" /><br />conc. will become half after reaction of an equal volume of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></math><br />So <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></math><br />Now,<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/dmigddcrhnblhpdzicwrkyihimaynhxvjqswiaukxnphlncckn.jpeg\" /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>12.8</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.05</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡<